OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening, with some drizzle.
OL,7,FCloud thickening in the early hours,
OL,8,Fwith further occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Farriving later in the night. Winds
OL,10,Fbecoming strong overnight, especially
OL,11,Fon coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FEarly heavy rain clearing
OL,14,Feastwards by late morning, then a
OL,15,Fbrighter day with sunny spells,
OL,16,Fperhaps with some isolated blustery
OL,17,Fshowers. Winds gradually easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
