OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells Wednesday, with isolated
OL,7,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Foggy
OL,8,FThursday morning, with sunny spells
OL,9,Flater. Likely mostly dry with sunny
OL,10,Fspells Friday. Temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
